1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,901
Dante: Fun fact. Zombies hate loud noise.
Honk the horn!

2
00:00:04,221 --> 00:00:08,882
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part three of ten: the horn.

3
00:00:09,202 --> 00:00:11,498
Priya: Dante. Noise is a dinner bell.

4
00:00:11,818 --> 00:00:14,025
Dante: Loud scares animals. It's science.

5
00:00:14,145 --> 00:00:16,983
Priya: They are not animals. They are
hungry.

6
00:00:17,303 --> 00:00:18,543
Dante: ...Hungry is worse.

7
00:00:18,903 --> 00:00:23,493
Rosa: Highway twelve. Dark. Quiet.
Suspiciously quiet.

8
00:00:23,813 --> 00:00:26,878
Dante: Vic. Hit the horn. Show them who's
boss.

9
00:00:26,998 --> 00:00:28,367
Vic: Chat, watch this!

10
00:00:28,687 --> 00:00:30,217
Vic: Chat... they're clapping.

11
00:00:30,337 --> 00:00:31,925
Dante: That's not the reaction I expected.

12
00:00:32,245 --> 00:00:34,432
Teddy: Gary says shh. Shh is a superpower.

13
00:00:34,752 --> 00:00:39,180
Priya: Real rule. Noise is a dinner bell.
Stay quiet, stay hidden.

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,378
Steve: Excuse me. Was that the dinner
bell?

15
00:00:42,498 --> 00:00:44,353
Rosa: ...Technically, yes.

16
00:00:44,673 --> 00:00:47,093
Vic: Chat, I got forty zombie subscribers.

17
00:00:47,413 --> 00:00:48,614
Lena: Don't read the comments.

18
00:00:49,013 --> 00:00:53,956
BUS-E: The signal repeats: bring your
ticket. Nobody has a ticket. Cozy!

19
00:00:54,276 --> 00:01:00,051
BUS-E: Part three of ten, the Last Bus, Route
twelve. Next: the slow ones. Follow for part four.

